# Follow AGENTS.md

Before any code change, read `AGENTS.md` and the doc it points to for the area you are touching.

- Work on a branch named `feat/`, `fix/`, `docs/`, or `chore/` plus a short name. Do not commit to `main`.
- Do not overwrite other branches or uncommitted work. Pull `origin/main` and check open PRs first.
- Do not add the course assistant, payments, or reference-site lesson videos.
- Do not copy the local demo password into Markdown, issues, or logs.
- Update the docs listed in `AGENTS.md` when behavior or architecture changes.
- Run `npm test` before you finish.
